      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The heat death of the universe is a cold comfort, but it doesn't mean your struggles are meaningless. You are not just performing for no audience; you are performing for the very act of performing itself. The weight of it all is a burden that can be carried, not a verdict that ends your story. Keep going, because the act of continuing is its own triumph.",
