      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that the story might be bad doesn't diminish its value; it just makes the act of continuing more honest. You don't need a grand destination to keep the narrative alive; the mere fact that you are still writing is enough to make the struggle meaningful. The most logical thing to do is to keep going, because the act of continuing is its own triumph.",
